    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player controls President Trump in this 2.5 Platformer game. Game contains 12 maps. Trump mission is to finish levels and collect money bags every level. Other countries have added traps and turtle and bee enemies, so that President Trump need to use all his skills to get more tariff trade moneys. Levels contains different traps like firetraps, spikes, moving spikes, cannons etc. Levels contains also 2 different moving and deathly enemies bees and turtles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Trump can avoid enemies or shoot them with flames. There are also some moving and jump platform which Trump can use. Some levels player need find key to open doors to continue level and also falling to lava will kill player and after death player will respawn to checkpoint area. <br>So can you make Usa great again and find all money bags end of every levels</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Input:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: W - A - S - D<br>Jump: Space<br>Double Jump: Space<br>Dash: Shift<br>Shoot Mouse Right Click</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 levels  <br>- End of level money bags which gives steam achievements<br>- Different traps like: Cannons, Fire traps, spike traps, moving traps<br>- Moving platforms<br>- Keys which opens unlocked doors<br>- Enemies: moving turtle and bee which kills player<br>- Player can shoot<br>- Coins to collect<br>- Checkpoint system. Balloon is checkpoint area<br>- Collect hearts to get more lifes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling out of map to lava etc will kill player</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player controls President Trump in this 2.5 Platformer game. Game contains 12 maps. Trump mission is to finish levels and collect money bags every level. Other countries have added traps and turtle and bee enemies, so that President Trump need to use all his skills to get more tariff trade moneys. Levels contains different traps like firetraps, spikes, moving spikes, cannons etc. Levels contains also 2 different moving and deathly enemies bees and turtles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Trump can avoid enemies or shoot them with flames. There are also some moving and jump platform which Trump can use. Some levels player need find key to open doors to continue level and also falling to lava will kill player and after death player will respawn to checkpoint area. <br>So can you make Usa great again and find all money bags end of every levels</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Input:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: W - A - S - D<br>Jump: Space<br>Double Jump: Space<br>Dash: Shift<br>Shoot Mouse Right Click</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 levels  <br>- End of level money bags which gives steam achievements<br>- Different traps like: Cannons, Fire traps, spike traps, moving traps<br>- Moving platforms<br>- Keys which opens unlocked doors<br>- Enemies: moving turtle and bee which kills player<br>- Player can shoot<br>- Coins to collect<br>- Checkpoint system. Balloon is checkpoint area<br>- Collect hearts to get more lifes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling out of map to lava etc will kill player</p></li></ul>",
